' INFO's numbers in a v1.2 game (`preset classic|extended ai amiga seed 3 start 30
' party give item_rat_trap,item_hand_pump`: a prepared state, not the game's).
' The companion is camped at Paradise Camp, the hand pump put down in the well
' and the rat trap in the tent; INFO is opened and maggots, then rats, chosen.
' Each opening logs `info (v1.2): food F a day, water W` — the numbers the
' screen shows, from `v12_day::food_rate` and `water_output`, which the day
' itself adds. Paradise Camp's spring gives 7: Classic (DOS rule) shows water
' 8, Extended (fixed +2) 9; maggots 2 and 1 a day, rats 3 and 3. The legacy
' formula showed 8 in both.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
join                     ' camped here: the place is ours
wait 10
mapclick 271,147         ' the well
wait 60
uiclick 204,248          ' the hand pump put down
wait 5
esc
wait 10
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
uiclick 168,248          ' the rat trap put down
wait 5
esc
wait 10
menu 300,150
menuline 1               ' INFO (v1.2's menu: FIGHT first)
wait 3
sceneclick 246,121       ' maggots
wait 3
sceneclick 246,121       ' rats
wait 3
quit
